<title>USA: US OPTIONS FOCUS/Compaq, Quantum lead tech options.</title>
<headline>US OPTIONS FOCUS/Compaq, Quantum lead tech options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Options on technology stocks were the main attraction Thursday, led by heavy activity in Compaq Computer Corp and Quantum Corp, traders said.</p>
<p>Both stocks were down in heavy late session trading. Compaq fell 2-3/16 to 100-1/8 on consolidated volume of 2.85 million shares and Quantum lost 1-1/4 to 19-3/4 on 7.76 million shares.</p>
<p>Traders said Compaq was hit by concerns about PC sales and its planned acquisition of Tandem Computers Inc for $3 billion, announced Monday.</p>
</text>
